<div class="chatbot" id="chatbot">
    <button class="btn chatbot__control" id="chat-float-btn">
        <div class="chatbot__control-image">
            <img src="https://visitmexico.com/gmx_assets/front__gmx_sep__images__gmx_sep__kuul__gmx_dot__png" alt="" height="126" width="124" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="low" decoding="async">
        </div>
        <div class="chatbot__control-content">
            <p>¿A dónde te<br/>gustaría ir?</p>
        </div>
    </button>
    <div class="chatbot__wrapper">
        <div class="chatbot__box" id="chat">
            <div class="chatbot__header">
                <img src="https://visitmexico.com/gmx_assets/front__gmx_sep__images__gmx_sep__kuul__gmx_dot__png" alt="" height="52" width="51" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="low" decoding="async">
                <h4 class="chatbot__header-title">Chat de ayuda</h4>
                <button class="btn" id="chat-close">
                    <img src="https://visitmexico.com/gmx_assets/front__gmx_sep__images__gmx_sep__icon__gmx_sep__close__gmx_dot__svg" alt="close" height="12" width="12" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="low" decoding="async">
                </button>
            </div>
            <div class="chatbot__history" id="chat-history">
                <div class="chatbot__message model static-message">
                    <ul class="chatbot__message-header">
                        <li class="name">Kúul</li>
                        <li class="time">
                            <time></time>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>¡Hola, mi nombre es Kúul! Cuéntame sobre tus intereses o el tipo de experiencias que estás buscando, para que pueda ofrecerte recomendaciones más personalizadas.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="chatbot__footer">
                <form action="#" id="chat-form" class="input-group input-group--right input-group--sm chatbot__input">
                    <textarea name="chat-input" id="chat-input" class="form-control chat-input" rows="1" required enterkeyhint="send" placeholder="Escribe tu mensaje" maxlength="400" autocomplete="off"></textarea>
                    <button type="submit" class="btn input-group__submit" aria-label="Enviar">
                        <img src="https://visitmexico.com/gmx_assets/front__gmx_sep__images__gmx_sep__icon__gmx_sep__send__gmx_dot__svg" alt="" height="21" width="20" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="low" decoding="async">
                    </button>
                    <div class="chatbot__loader">
                        <div class="loader-points"></div>
                    </div>
                </form>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

